msgid "Increases the potency of the next spell cast by 50%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br>Effect cannot be stacked with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Harmonized</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
