msgid "Deals physical damage to all enemies in a straight line before you with a potency of 200 for the first enemy, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Potency is increased to 600 when target is afflicted with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Petrification</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. The <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Petrification</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effect is also removed."
